# Projects to audit — one ID per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
#
#   cp config/projects.txt.example config/projects.txt
#
# Used two ways:
#   ./run-audit.sh --projects config/projects.txt      audit every one
#   go run rollup.go -projects config/projects.txt     the denominator for
#                                                      organization coverage
#
# For the organization score this list is the ESTATE, not the backlog: it is
# what "audited 12 of 40 projects" divides by. Keep it the full list even
# while you work through it one project at a time.
#
# Generate it from the live organization:
#   gcloud projects list --filter='lifecycleState:ACTIVE' --format='value(projectId)' > config/projects.txt

acme-prod-web
acme-prod-data
acme-dev-sandbox
